{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JjggEhThlH1793631809.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>葵涌荃灣路有兩輛私家車及一輛小巴相撞，九人輕傷。</p><p></p><p>涉事紅色小巴擋風玻璃碎裂，車頭凹陷，前方的黑色私家車，車尾玻璃爆裂，車頭損毀。至於白色私家車，車尾被撞至凹陷。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TW-2130_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GcSwH6mB3A1793631908.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方指晚上七時半接報，指三輛車在荃灣路往荃灣方向行駛，近葵順街遊樂場對開相撞。九人受輕傷。有傷者清醒，之後自行步上救護車。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TW-2130_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UWVrHbVkLL1793631922.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>意外原因仍在調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:05.695065+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:38:27.503665+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T15:58:28.760987+00:00","content_hash":"2142bc61d54b20172cb8be6899a11a022ce56242e5eaef4f1ba23d557ebcf983","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:05.695065+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}